   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-18), added to the scope:** remove the end-of-page hint « Tirer vers le haut pour actualiser » from the reader (`TopicHTMLBuilder.swift:101-103`, `ReaderRenderOptions.offersPullToRefresh`, `TopicReaderModel+Composer.swift:20`). It replaces the operator decision of 2026-11-16 on #932 (« visible at rest »).\n\nThe growing icon of this issue is the only cue now. The reader already has a bottom pull: `ReaderPullWatcher` (`ReaderPageEnd.swift`, threshold 72 pt, release past the end). Build the growing icon and the haptic on that watcher rather than adding a second mechanism, and keep its threshold as the named constant. Update the tests that pin the hint (#820, #932).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
